# VETMECH native VPS SEO routing
#
# Use the checked installer rather than replacing a whole virtual host:
#   sudo python3 scripts/install_nginx_seo.py          # inspect target only
#   sudo python3 scripts/install_nginx_seo.py --apply  # backup, nginx -t, reload
#
# The installer renders deploy/nginx-seo-locations.conf.template for the current
# checkout, backend port 8010 and vetmechpharma.in. It changes only the existing
# HTTPS content host with that domain and frontend root. Redirect-only hosts,
# TLS certificates and unrelated applications are retained. Unsupported or
# ambiguous existing configurations are refused instead of guessed.
#
# The generated include provides real /robots.txt and /sitemap.xml endpoints,
# current public /products/ redirects and server-rendered titles/content for
# search and social crawlers. Static JS/CSS/images never enter crawler rendering.
#
# See docs/SEO_INDEXING.md for deployment, verification and Search Console steps.
